      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
    <div class="sub faint" style="margin-top:8px">{{ t('Each currency\'s average appreciation against all the others over the window (bars, standardized), with its move vs USD on the right. Built from the dollar-orthogonalized pair residuals. DESCRIPTIVE trailing trend — green never means buy. EM/managed currencies (CNH, MXN, BRL) are noisier.', '每种货币在该周期内相对其他所有货币的平均升值（柱状，标准化），右侧为其相对美元的变动。基于剥离美元的货币对残差构建。描述性近端趋势 — 绿色绝不代表买入。新兴/受管理货币（离岸人民币、墨西哥比索、巴西雷亚尔）噪声更大。') }}</div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== §04 · PER-PAIR SIGNAL BOARD ===================== -->
